OL,3,AServices being held across UK to mark
OL,4,AArmistice Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FServices are being held across the UK
OL,7,Fand around the world to mark Armistice
OL,8,FDay, commemorating the end of World War
OL,9,FOne.
OL,11,FA national two-minute silence will take
OL,12,Fplace at 11:00 GMT to mark the end of
OL,13,Fthat war and to remember those who have
OL,14,Fdied in all conflicts since.
OL,16,FA service at the Cenotaph memorial in
OL,17,FWhitehall will be attended by
OL,18,Fgovernment ministers, senior
OL,19,Finternational military figures,
OL,20,Fschoolchildren and cadets.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
